    "body": "Update on `data:` URLs. They cannot be navigated to in top-level browsing contexts so it's mostly moot, but we haven't exactly enforced that fully. I think if user agents do allow navigation to them in a top-level browsing context they should always ensure that it's a fresh browsing context group, especially if the creator is from a COOP browsing context group.",
