    "updated_at": "2021-02-01T15:12:44Z",
    "body": "I think that is fine as it would also happen if you navigated B to another A. The weird thing might be that it'll be a (useless) blank document, but I don't see a reason to add a special case for that. User agents might want to show this as some kind of error to end users? Not sure.",
